  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1102/224/relics_full_1000-png.png\" alt=\"遗物（RPG系列）\"></p>\n<h2>🎖 用强大的饰品释放你的真正潜力！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | NeoForge-ecebe6?labelColor=263768&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"模组加载器\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ecosystem-Spell_Engine-orange?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"SpellEngine\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/KN9b3pjFTM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973561601519149057.svg?label=&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&color=7389D8&labelColor=6A7EC2&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>✨ 探索更多 RPG 系列内容</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/169/archers_full_275.png\" alt=\"弓箭手\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/paladins-and-priests\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/170/paladins_full_275.png\" alt=\"圣骑士\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/755/171/wizards_full_275.png\" alt=\"巫师\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rogues-and-warriors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/899/332/rogues_full_bg_275.png\" alt=\"盗贼\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/865/skilltree_275-png.png\" alt=\"技能树\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/760/387/jewelry_full_275.png\" alt=\"珠宝\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/arsenal-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1103/295/arsenal_full_275-png.png\" alt=\"军械库\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/armory-rpg-series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/866/armory_275-png.png\" alt=\"武器库\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h1>📦 安装</h1>\n<h3>必需</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Engine</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>强烈推荐</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jewelry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-roll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Combat Roll</a> 部分遗物提供与翻滚相关的加成</li>\n</ul>\n<h1>🔮 功能</h1>\n<p>获取强大的战斗饰品，提升你的法术与战斗技巧。探索 40 余种独特道具，每种都拥有不同的加成与精美立绘。</p>\n<p>其中一部分可通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Jewelry</a> 的宝石进行合成。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1102/221/item_figurine-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></p>\n<p>大部分物品可从地牢宝箱、半首领（如唤魔者）以及首领（如凋灵和末影龙）处获得。</p>\n<p>战利品表注入可在 <code>config/rpg_series/loot_items.json</code> 中进行配置。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1102/225/relics_loot-png.png\" alt=\"战利品\"></p>\n<h1>⭐️ 示例</h1>\n<p>体验这些遗物提供的丰富多样的主动与被动技能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1102/219/item_common-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1102/223/item_uncommon-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1102/222/item_rare-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1102/220/item_epic-png.png\" alt=\"遗物\"></p>\n<h1>专为多人游戏设计</h1>\n<p>创建你自己的 RPG 服务器。使用我们的优惠码可享受更低价格，同时也能支持我们。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fRPG_SERIES\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/88e9c178-fe70-4122-8b9b-97d2feb48c2a.png\" alt=\"获取服务器\"></a></p>\n<h1>🎁 想要更多内容？</h1>\n<p>探索由我们亲爱的合作伙伴制作的各类 Spell Engine 模组！</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rpg-minibosses-forsaken-adventurers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1358/177/anarchy-png.png\" alt=\"无政府\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mercenaries-and-artificers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/857/merc_275-png.png\" alt=\"雇佣兵与工匠\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/archers-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/945/archers_expansion_275-png.png\" alt=\"弓箭手扩展（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n<th><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berserker-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/946/berserker_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"狂战士（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/947/elemental_wizards_275-png.png\" alt=\"元素巫师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/948/forcemaster_275-png.png\" alt=\"力量大师（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1346/949/witcher_mod_275-png.png\" alt=\"猎魔人（更多 RPG 职业）\"></a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/death-knights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/953/998/death_knights_275_2.png\" alt=\"死亡骑士\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
